  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      515.82,
      295.22,
      601.38
    ],
    "text": "The Allotments of land depicted in the Advance TracingNo. Ma/GLW/2017/398 dated of 14.02.2018 prepared by the SeniorSuperintendent of Surveys - Matale District on behalf of the SurveyorGeneral, situated in the village of Pahala Bambawa in the GramaNiladhari Division of (No. E 432 E) Pahala Bambawa and MinorDivision of Kandapalla Korale and in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Galewela of Matale District in Central Province anddescribed in below names and extents as follows.",
